## Puppeteer post-install: never fetch Chromium during dependency install.
## The PDF build script (scripts/build-presentation-pdf.mjs) runs LOCALLY
## against my machine's own Chromium; the built PDF gets committed as a
## static asset. Railway / CI never needs Chrome — this prevents the
## ~170MB Chromium download from blocking deploy or exceeding disk limits.
PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=true
